The Eunoia signature recorded in install/defs/Cpc.cached.eo is a copy of the
Cooperating Proof Calculus as defined by the cvc5 project
(https://github.com/cvc5/cvc5), which is licensed under the modified BSD
license.  The Lean sources generated from it -- Cpc/Logos.lean,
Cpc/LogosTerm.lean, Cpc/Parser.lean, Cpc/Spec.lean, Cpc/SmtEval.lean,
Cpc/SmtModel.lean, Cpc/SmtModelDefs.lean, Cpc/SmtValueOrder.lean,
Cpc/Proofs/RuleLemmas.lean and their CpcMini equivalents -- are derived from
that signature.  The copyright of the signature is held by the cvc5 authors.

